<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Norfolk Southern cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said on Thursday it lowered its rating on the shares of Norfolk Southern Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock dropped 1-3/4 to 111-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
